1. I am the ____________ (state position) and duly authorized representative of _______________, a domestic corporation duly organized, registered and existing under and by virtue of the laws of the Republic of the Philippines, with office address at ____________ and Tax Identification No. ____________. (hereinafter "the Corporation"). I am submitting the attached copy of the Secretary's Certificate issued by the Corporation as proof of my authority to act on its behalf;

2. As the ____________ (state position) of the Corporation, it is part of my duties and responsibilities, among others, to oversee the preparation of the Corporation's books of account and financial statements and computation of income tax and all other tax dues; aDSIHc

3. For the period _________ to _________, the Corporation has a total pending claim for Excise Tax Credit/Refund in the amount of _________ arising from ____________ (state brief nature of claim and covered period) as shown in the Application Form 1914 attached herewith as Annex "A" and made integral part hereof;

4. I hereby attest that out of the total pending claim for Excise Tax Credit/Refund in the amount of ____________, the amount of ____________ pertains to the Corporation's pending claim with the Bureau of Internal Revenue (BIR) while the amount of ____________ pertains to the Corporation's pending claim with the Bureau of Customs (BOC);

