7. Based on the Corporation's records, the excise taxes in the total amount of ____________ were not passed on to the Corporation's customers and neither recorded as expenses in the books of account and computation of taxable income;

8. All documents presented and submitted as stated in the transmittal list are complete for purposes of supporting our claim for Excise Tax Credit/Tax Refund;

9. This is being made in compliance with the requirements for claims for Excise Tax Credit/Refund on petroleum products pursuant to BIR Revenue Memorandum Order No. ______ and related issuances;

10. I attest to the truth and veracity of all the foregoing statements under the penalty of perjury.

IN WITNESS WHEREOF, I have hereunto set my hand this _____ day of _______________ at ____________.

_______________
Affiant

