2.16 Receive request for reproduction of scanned copy of the records/documents/dockets duly approved/authorized by the Commissioner;

2.17 Release the reproduced copy with acknowledgment receipt to requesting office;

2.18 Maintain a record of all scanned records/documents/dockets reproduced.

