d. Request for an updated Certification of Outstanding Tax Liability and/or Certification on Status of Pending Legal Case of the taxpayer-claimants from the concerned Revenue District Offices (RDOs), Collection and Legal Divisions under the jurisdiction of the concerned regional office, as well as from the Accounts Receivable Monitoring Division (ARMD) in the National Office;

