2.1 Conduct verification of DS-EIM and the relative operations in cases of retirement and transfer;

2.2 Submit verification report to CPD.

3. The Collection Division of the Concerned Revenue Region shall —

3.1 Monitor collection of DST and DS-EIM of the RDOs under the jurisdiction of the Region.

4. The Revenue Accounting Division shall —

4.1 Receive Monthly Report of DST Collection by Region/RDO (Annex "H") and Monthly Report of DST Collection by Type of Transaction (Annex "I") from CPD;

